culinary-description-chop = 6 s · no heat. Accelerates absorption of starchy ingredients.
culinary-description-grind = 8 s · no heat. Trades lasting satiety for faster absorption.
culinary-description-soak = 25 s · 15% water. Softens side effects and some beneficial properties.
culinary-description-marinate = 35 s · acid required. Reduces heaviness and changes absorption.
culinary-description-boil = 30 s · power and 15% water. Cooks raw proteins.
culinary-description-simmer = 60 s · power and 15% water. Favors longer-lasting effects.
culinary-description-reduce = 45 s · power. Evaporates half the water, concentrating the mixture.
culinary-description-fry = 20 s · power and fat. Brings out warming effects and heaviness.
culinary-description-bake = 45 s · power. Favors satiety and weakens sensitive properties.
culinary-description-steam = 35 s · power and 15% water. Reduces heaviness and discomfort.
